  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Ciencia y Tecnologa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science and Technology Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es contribuir al mejoramiento de los niveles de competitividad del pas a travs del fortalecimiento de las capacidades de investigacin y de innovacin tecnolgica involucrando a empresas y a instituciones pblicas y privadas de Paraguay.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program&apos;s objective is to contribute to the improvement of the country&apos;s levels of competitiveness through the strengthening of the research and technology innovation capacities involving enterprises, and public and private institutions in Paraguay.</narrative>
  </description>
